&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:120%;&quot;&gt;I hope you enjoy your stay! :&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
