&lt;p&gt;A harsh static lashes out of the speakers when you open the file. It disturbs the stillness of the room, catches you off guard and quickens your heart&#039;s pace. There&#039;s some handling noise as the recorder adjusts their microphone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A brief moment of silence passes and then:&lt;/p&gt;
